"setting changed (operator, name, routes…), Tailscale refuses this incomplete"
" \"up\": systemd then stops tailscaled and gives up after five attempts (the"
" machine leaves the tailnet). omega-tail adds \"-\" in front of this "
"command: its refusal no longer stops the service, and your settings stay "
"kept by Tailscale. Nothing else changes; the original is kept in var/survie."

