"encryption, its fingerprint (JA4), its AS and its country. When incoming "
"connections exceed the threshold, the gate switches to ATTACK MODE on its "
"own: an unknown fingerprint that explodes, a hosting AS or a chosen country "
"that exceeds its rate is then refused. Common browsers are never affected; "
"known clients go ahead of the budget. In observation, everything is counted "
"(\"would have refused\") and nothing is refused."

